      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# 提供给main.py用的UI渲染函数 + 命令command注册对象\n\n# 1. UI打印（判断多种part情况、美化、渲染）\ndef print_part(part) -> None:\n\n\n# 2. Command 命令抽象类，所有斜杠命令都要注册成 Command 对象\nclass Command:\n    name: str\n    description: str\n    handler: Callable[[\"SessionState\"], bool]\n\nCOMMANDS = {\n    \"new\": Command(\"new\", \"开启新会话\", cmd_new),\n    \"resume\": Command(\"resume\", \"恢复历史会话\", cmd_resume),\n    \"status\": Command(\"status\", \"显示当前会话状态\", cmd_status),\n    \"api-detail\": Command(\"api-detail\", \"显示最近一轮 model API 调用详情\", cmd_api_detail),\n    \"help\": Command(\"help\", \"显示可用命令\", cmd_help),\n    \"exit\": Command(\"exit\", \"退出程序\", cmd_exit),\n}",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# 提供给main.py用的UI渲染函数 + 命令command注册对象\n\n# 1. UI打印（判断多种part情况、美化、渲染）\ndef print_part(part) -> None:\n\n\n# 2. Command 命令抽象类，所有斜杠命令都要注册成 Command 对象\nclass Command:\n    name: str\n    description: str\n    handler: Callable[[\"SessionState\"], bool]\n\nCOMMANDS = {\n    \"new\": Command(\"new\", \"开启新会话\", cmd_new),\n    \"resume\": Command(\"resume\", \"恢复历史会话\", cmd_resume),\n    \"status\": Command(\"status\", \"显示当前会话状态\", cmd_status),\n    \"api-detail\": Command(\"api-detail\", \"显示最近一轮 model API 调用详情\", cmd_api_detail),\n    \"help\": Command(\"help\", \"显示可用命令\", cmd_help),\n    \"exit\": Command(\"exit\", \"退出程序\", cmd_exit),\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AaexNdQ-lvalSmstZl7P5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 431.6055481925797,
      "y": -3736.8968253968214,
      "width": 1268.979248046875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "_TQ7JC7quyO54-cR8Tlmt"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2047797372,
      "version": 796,
      "versionNonce": 222118031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792333811983,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SessionState/对话状态： \n1. 创建：记录当下对话的上下文信息（class在commands.py中声明, 但是main.py的main()里实例化的）\n2. 内容：   1. history: list = field(default_factory=list)         # 全量上下文消息历史\n              2. input_tokens: int = 0                                # 本session流入大模型的token累积量\n              3. output_tokens: int = 0                              # 本session大模型输出的token累积量\n              4. model_name: str = \"\"\n              5. session_id: str = \"\"                                   # 当前会话 ID（决定写入哪个 jsonl 文件）  \n              6. last_api_calls: list = field(default_factory=list)    # 最近一轮对话触发的 API 调用日志\n              7. read_file_state: ReadFileState = field(default_factory=ReadFileState)    # 本会话的 readFileState\n              8. tasks_store: TasksStore | None = None      # 本会话的 TasksStore，落盘在 ~/.my-code-agent/tasks/<session_id>/\n3. 传递：作为参数显式传给 run_agent_loop(user_input, state) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SessionState/对话状态： \n1. 创建：记录当下对话的上下文信息（class在commands.py中声明, 但是main.py的main()里实例化的）\n2. 内容：   1. history: list = field(default_factory=list)         # 全量上下文消息历史\n              2. input_tokens: int = 0                                # 本session流入大模型的token累积量\n              3. output_tokens: int = 0                              # 本session大模型输出的token累积量\n              4. model_name: str = \"\"\n              5. session_id: str = \"\"                                   # 当前会话 ID（决定写入哪个 jsonl 文件）  \n              6. last_api_calls: list = field(default_factory=list)    # 最近一轮对话触发的 API 调用日志\n              7. read_file_state: ReadFileState = field(default_factory=ReadFileState)    # 本会话的 readFileState\n              8. tasks_store: TasksStore | None = None      # 本会话的 TasksStore，落盘在 ~/.my-code-agent/tasks/<session_id>/\n3. 传递：作为参数显式传给 run_agent_loop(user_input, state) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
